  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a sous-vide machine to 150°F (65°C).",
    "In a bowl, mix together cottage cheese, dried chilli flakes, turmeric, cumin seeds and salt.",
    "Place one tortilla in a separate bowl and brush with ghee or vegan butter.",
    "Place the tortilla on a sous-vide mat and fill with the cottage cheese mixture.",
    "Cook the quesadilla for 30 minutes in the sous-vide machine.",
    "Heat a non-stick skillet over medium heat and place the cooked quesadilla.",
    "Melt the cheese and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, until crispy and golden brown.",
    "Cut into wedges and garnish with chopped cilantro, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
